  "cover_text": "I was watching TV with Devin the other day and the Water Terror episode was very interesting. One of the players was in a commercial sesame seeds episode. Needless to say in the water he played a winner that was spinning around on a coaster. However, some member took the contestant it spun them one more time and he couldn't go through it. After identifying the area where cracking started, Jackie joined in to try to set up a barrier in front of his teeth. At one point he was in trouble with Freddie when all that you could hear is the door of the enclosure, he was doing a bite and his hugging. \nWhat is the answer to this question: Who did Jackie try to set up?\nhis teethHuman-2 programmer Jamie Drew was introduced to Atron Mazda,",
